### ===========================================
### Traffic Lights API Tests
### ===========================================

### GET all traffic lights - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json

### GET single traffic light - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/1
Accept: application/json

### GET single traffic light - 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/9999
Accept: application/json

### POST create traffic light - 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "installationDate": "2024-01-15",
  "direction": "N",
  "type": "COLLISION",
  "rightArrow": false,
  "intersectionId": 1
}

### POST create traffic light - 400 Bad Request (missing required fields)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "rightArrow": true
}

### POST create traffic light - 400 Bad Request (future installation date)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "installationDate": "2030-12-31",
  "direction": "S",
  "type": "NON_COLLISION",
  "rightArrow": false,
  "intersectionId": 1
}

### POST create traffic light - 404 Not Found (non-existent intersection)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "installationDate": "2024-01-15",
  "direction": "E",
  "type": "COLLISION",
  "rightArrow": false,
  "intersectionId": 9999
}

### DELETE traffic light - 204 No Content
### WARNING: This will actually delete the traffic light!
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/5
Accept: application/json

### DELETE non-existent traffic light - 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/9999
Accept: application/json

### PATCH traffic light - 204 No Content (update status only)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "MAINTENANCE"
}

### PATCH traffic light - 204 No Content (update multiple fields)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "direction": "SW",
  "rightArrow": true
}

### PATCH traffic light - 404 Not Found
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/traffic-lights/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### ===========================================
### Intersections API Tests
### ===========================================

### GET traffic lights for intersection - 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/intersections/1/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json

### GET traffic lights for non-existent intersection - 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/intersections/9999/traffic-lights
Accept: application/json


